# Beautiful example scene with multiple materials
# Format: sphere (x,y,z) size material (r,g,b) [fuzz/refraction]

# Large ground sphere (gray)
sphere (0,-1000,0) 1000 lambertian (0.5,0.5,0.5)

# Center: Large glass sphere
sphere (0,1,0) 1.0 dialetric 1.5

# Left: Red diffuse sphere
sphere (-4,1,0) 1.0 lambertian (0.4,0.2,0.1)

# Right: Gold metal sphere
sphere (4,1,0) 1.0 metal (0.7,0.6,0.5) 0.0

# Small random spheres on the ground
